#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2654 lib/html.php:2900
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Game da Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "An tsara Cacti ya zama cikakkiyar mafita ta zana jadawali bisa RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) da mafitar Zana Jadawali. Manufarsa ita ce sauƙaƙa aikin Mai Gudanar da Hanyar Sadarwa ta hanyar kula da duk muhimman bayanai da ake buƙata don ƙirƙirar Jadawalai masu ma'ana."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Da fatan za a duba %sshafin yanar gizon Cacti%s na hukuma don bayani kan yadda ake amfani da Cacti, samun tallafi, da sabuntawa."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Masu Haɓakawa Masu Aiki"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Masu haɓakawa da ke aiki a kan Cacti, Tsarin sa, Takardu da Fitowa na Gaba."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Yabo na Musamman"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Masu ba da gudummawa ga Takardu, QA, Shirya Kunshi, Zauren Tattaunawa da shafinmu na YouTube."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Tsofaffin Mambobi"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Mambobin tsohon Cacti Group waɗanda suka ci gaba a cikin ayyukansu. Muna ci gaba da yi musu fatan alheri."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Mun gode"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Godiya ta musamman ga %sTobi Oetiker%s, wanda ya ƙirƙiri %sRRDtool%s da kuma shahararren %sMRTG%s."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Masu amfani da Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Musamman duk wanda ya ba da lokaci don ƙirƙirar rahoton matsala, ko kuma ya taimaka wajen gyara matsalolin da suka shafi Cacti. Haka kuma ga duk wanda ya ba da gudummawa wajen tallafawa Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Lasisi"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti yana da lasisi ƙarƙashin GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Wannan shirin software ce kyauta; za ka iya sake rarraba ta da/ko gyara ta ƙarƙashin sharuɗɗan Lasisin Jama'a na GNU kamar yadda Free Software Foundation ta buga; ko dai sigar 2 ta Lasisin, ko (a zaɓinka) kowace siga ta baya."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Ana rarraba wannan shirin ne da fatan zai yi amfani, amma BA TARE DA WANI GARANTI BA; ko da ba tare da garantin da aka ambata na KASUWANCI ko DACEWA DA WATA MANUFA TA MUSAMMAN ba. Duba Lasisin Jama'a na GNU (GNU General Public License) don ƙarin bayani."

