msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Bayani"

#: include/global_form.php:922
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Cika Sarari Ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_form.php:926
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Cika rubutu domin bayani da bayanan jadawali su riƙa daidaitawa koyaushe. Lura: wannan na iya sa jadawalai su ɗauki tsawon lokaci kafin su fito saboda ƙarin aiki. Haka kuma Auto Padding na iya ba ya yi daidai a kowane nau'in jadawalai, daidaitaccen sa suna yawanci yana taimakawa."

#: include/global_form.php:929
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Lakabobi Masu Sauyawa (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php:932
