msgstr "Debug na Plugin na Zaɓi"

#: include/global_settings.php:303
msgid "Select which Plugins you wish to place in Debug mode regardless of the Generic Log Level setting.  Any files used by this plugin will be treated as they are in Debug mode."
msgstr "Zaɓi waɗanne Plugins kake son sawa a yanayin Debug ba tare da la'akari da saitin Matakin Log na Gabaɗaya ba.  Duk wani fayil da wannan plugin ya yi amfani da shi za a ɗauke shi kamar yana cikin yanayin Debug."

