msgstr "A lokutan da sabar Cacti ke fuskantar matsaloli, shin ya kamata a sanar da Babban Mai Gudanarwa ta Imel? Ana ayyana asusun mai amfani na Cacti na Babban Mai Gudanarwa a ƙarƙashin shafin Tantancewa a shafin saitunan Cacti. Saitinsa na asali shine asusun 'admin'."

#: include/global_settings.php:1899
