msgstr "Tashar TCP don sadarwa mai rufin asiri."

#: include/global_settings.php:2369 include/global_settings.php:2401
#: utilities.php:317
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "Sawun Yatsa na RSA"

#: include/global_settings.php:2370
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Sawun yatsa na maɓallin RSA na jama'a na yanzu da wakilin ke amfani da shi. Ana buƙatar wannan don kafa haɗi amintacce."

#: include/global_settings.php:2377
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "Sabar Proxy ta RRDtool - Ajiyar Baya"

#: include/global_settings.php:2382
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Daidaita Nauyi (Load Balancing)"

#: include/global_settings.php:2383
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Idan duka babban proxy da na ajiyar baya suna karɓar bayanai, wannan zaɓin yana ba da damar rarraba duk buƙatu zuwa RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php:2388
