#: lib/installer.php:2169
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Idan an sami matsaloli, Ana ba da shawara sosai da ka share cache na burauzarka, ka rufe sannan ka sake buɗe burauzarka (ba kawai shafin da Cacti ke kai ba) sannan ka sake gwadawa, kafin tuntuɓar The Cacti Group da matsalar"

#: lib/installer.php:2170
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "A lokuta na musamman, mun sami rahotanni daga masu amfani waɗanda suka fuskanci wasu ƙananan matsaloli saboda sauye-sauye a lambar shirin. Waɗannan matsaloli suna faruwa ne saboda burauzar tana riƙe da lambar kafin haɓakawa kuma duk da mun ɗauki matakai don rage yiwuwar hakan, har yanzu yana iya faruwa. Idan kana buƙatar umarni kan yadda za a share cache na burauzarka, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> wuri ne mai kyau na farawa."

#: lib/installer.php:2171
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Idan bayan share cache da sake kunna burauzar ku, har yanzu kuna fuskantar matsaloli, da fatan za a tuntuɓe mu da matsalar kuma za mu yi ƙoƙarin gano musabbabinta."

