#: utilities.php:2355
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Rajistar Cacti Log tana adana ƙididdiga, kuskure da sauran saƙonni dangane da saitunan tsari.  Ana iya amfani da wannan bayanin don gano matsaloli tare da poller da manhaja."

#: utilities.php:2359
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Yana bai wa Masu Gudanarwa damar bincika log ɗin mai amfani. Masu Gudanarwa za su iya tacewa da fitar da log ɗin kuma."

#: utilities.php:2363
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Gudanar da Taskar Poller"

#: utilities.php:2366
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Waɗannan su ne bayanan da ake miƙawa ga poller duk lokacin da ya yi aiki. Sa'an nan ana aiwatar da/fassara waɗannan bayanan kuma ana shigar da sakamakon cikin RRDfiles don zana jadawali ko rumbun bayanai don nunawa."

#: utilities.php:2370
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Ma'ajiyar Tambayar Bayanai tana adana bayanan da aka tattara daga nau'ikan shigarwar Tambayar Bayanai. Ana iya amfani da ƙimomi daga waɗannan filaye a yankin rubutu na Jadawalai don Maɓallan Bayani (Legends), Alamomi na Tsaye, da GPRINTS da kuma a cikin CDEF's."

#: utilities.php:2372
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Sake Gina Taskar Poller"

#: utilities.php:2376
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Za a sake ƙirƙirar Ma'ajiyar Poller idan ka zaɓi wannan zaɓin. Yi amfani da wannan zaɓin ne kawai idan rumbun bayanai ya faɗi idan kana fuskantar matsaloli bayan faɗuwar kuma ka riga ka gudanar da kayan aikin gyaran rumbun bayanai.  A madadin haka, idan kana samun matsaloli da wata takamaiman Na'ura, kawai sake ajiye wannan Na'urar don sake gina Ma'ajiyar Poller ɗinta.  Akwai kuma kwatankwacin wannan umarnin a layin umarni wanda aka ba da shawara ga manyan tsaruka."

#: utilities.php:2378
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "LURA: A manyan tsare-tsare, wannan umarnin na iya ɗaukar mintuna zuwa sa'o'i don kammalawa saboda haka bai kamata a gudanar da shi daga fuskar Cacti UI ba. Za ka iya kawai gudanar da 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' a layin umarni don ƙarin bayani."

#: utilities.php:2382
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Sake Gina Taskar Albarkatu"

#: utilities.php:2386
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Lokacin gudanar da Masu Tara Bayanai da yawa a cikin Cacti, Cacti zai yi ƙoƙarin kiyaye yanayi don mahimman fayiloli a kan dukkan Masu Tara Bayanai.  Wannan ya haɗa da dukkan ainihin fayilolin shafin yanar gizo da plugin waɗanda ba na shigarwa ba.  Lokacin da ka tilasta sake gina Ma'ajiyar Albarkatu, Cacti zai share Ma'ajiyar Albarkatu ta gida, sannan ya sake gina ta a farawar poller na gaba da aka tsara.  Wannan zai sa dukkan Masu Tara Bayanai na Nesa su sake duba fayilolin shafin yanar gizo da plugin ɗinsu don daidaito."

